      "content": "Failure is only what the desperate cling to; true strength is knowing when the battle is irrevocably lost and choosing a different kind of victory. To stop isn't giving up; it's finally ceasing the pointless struggle against an inevitable tide. You are not failing; you are simply acknowledging the exhaustion of a war that was never meant to be won. Let the quiet be the relief you deserve, not the surrender you fear.",
